sion artifact s5-seam-map-and-oracle-design.md. AC6 is an operator-attested AWS deploy/E2E canary (infra/gerrit/reviewbot-e2e.sh).\n\nNEXT: finish held-out oracles -> dispatch implementer (happy-path + constraints only) -> validate against held-out oracle -> land via Gerrit (both +1) -> operator-attest AC6 -> close with --ref."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787064224099114001,"uuid":"5ecd1977-e978-450d-a02a-3eb9083f9627"}